# Claude Code

Read `AGENTS.md` first. The normal authored surface is the manifest,
`src/index.ts`, and optional custom handlers/services/routes. Do not edit
`.mantle/generated/` by hand.

Matching Core skills are projected under `.claude/skills/`:

- `.claude/skills/mantle-develop/SKILL.md`
- `.claude/skills/mantle-plugin/SKILL.md`
- `.claude/skills/mantle-theme/SKILL.md`
- `.claude/skills/mantle-update/SKILL.md`

Run `pnpm check` before shipping. Advanced code may use public low-level
Mantle/Cloudflare exports; the minimal façade is a default, not a restriction.
